doc episodes 7 Episode 1: "Behind Closed Doors" — Tension at Arsenal as Declan Rice clashes with the coaching staff.
Cold open: The episode opens on a quiet morning at the training ground.
The row: After being left out of the starting line-up, Declan Rice is seen in a heated exchange with the coaching staff on the training pitch. Luca Okoro steps in to separate them.
Training ground: A rare clean bill of health for the squad. 
Closing: The season has barely started. Next up: Arsenal Legends (Pre-season friendly) on 8 Aug. The narrator closes the episode: "In this building, there is no such thing as a quiet week." 
QUOTES T (Manager): Nobody is bigger than Arsenal. I pick the team that gives us the best chance to win, and that is the end of it.
Luca Okoro (Assistant manager): Frustration is fine. Showing it in front of the whole squad is not.
Andre Vaughan (Academy player): The gaffer told me to stay ready. That's all I'm doing, staying ready.
Narrator (Series voice-over): Behind every badge there is a dressing room. Behind every dressing room, a secret.
